codex
The production change is one flag: stable lock files now open in binary mode. I also made the tests honor Windows byte-range locking: held witness bytes are read through the owning descriptor, and the path-replacement probe now validates that Windows’ stable open handle blocks rename while POSIX still exercises replacement detection.
